---

This addon uses Minecraft (Mojang Studios / Microsoft) as the game platform
and NeoForge (NeoForged team) as the mod loader. Neither Minecraft nor
NeoForge is shipped in this repository — Gradle downloads them when compiling.
The addon code (files under src/) is MIT, as above.

Ribbits, GeckoLib, YUNG's API and Kotlin for Forge are separate mods with
their own licenses. Companion jars on GitHub Releases are official Modrinth
builds, rehosted only so the current version can be installed from one page.
